    "content": "Chapter I: Welcome &amp; Campuses | PES University Handbook ✕ Chapter I Welcome to PES University \"The pursuit of excellence is a continuous journey of discovery, dedication, and character.\" FOUNDED 1988 INTEGRITY • EXCELLENCE • ACADEMIA Introduction Congratulations, and welcome to the PES University family! 🎉 Starting college is an exciting milestone, and with it comes plenty of questions - where to go, who to contact, what to expect, and how to make the most of your time here. That's exactly what this handbook is here for. Think of this as your friendly guide to life at PESU. Whether you're looking for campus information, university resources, or tips to navigate your first few weeks, we've got you covered. This handbook is a living document, so we'll continue adding new information, useful resources, and handy tips to make your PESU journey even smoother. Here's to an unforgettable four years filled with learning, friendships, and memories! Our Campuses Ring Road (RR) Campus The Ring Road Campus is the university's flagship campus and home to the highest number of academic departments. It features outstanding infrastructure, research blocks, sports setups, and campus facilities. 📍 Outer Ring Road, Banashankari, Bengaluru View on Google Maps 🗺️ ESTATE RR CAMPUS ESTATE EC CAMPUS Electronic City (EC) Campus Located in the heart of Electronic City, this campus offers a spacious and modern learning environment. It is rapidly expanding, with a teaching hospital and medical college, making it an exciting hub for future growth. 📍 Hosur Road, Electronic City, Bengaluru View on Google Maps 🗺️ Hanumanth Nagar (HN) Campus The Hanumanth Nagar Campus is one of PES University's original campuses and continues to host select academic programmes while carrying forward the institution's rich legacy. 📍 BSK 1st Stage, Hanumanth Nagar, Bengaluru View on Google Maps 🗺️ ESTATE HN CAMPUS University Leadership PES UNIVERSITY FOUNDER Late Dr. M. R. Doreswamy Founder PES UNIVERSITY CHANCELLOR Prof. Jawahar Doreswamy Chancellor PES UNIVERSITY VICE CHANCELLOR Dr. J. Suryaprasad Vice Chancellor PES UNIVERSITY DEAN Dr. V. Krishna Dean, Student Affairs PES UNIVERSITY REGISTRAR Dr. K. S. Sridhar Registrar They, along with the faculty and staff, work towards creating an environment that encourages innovation, academic excellence, and holistic student development. READ SPEED --- WPM COMPLETED: 0%"
